Read against S53 section 5, written before this ran: a negative
marginal association that largely disappears under conditioning IS
the predicted result, and a null conditional association is a finding
and not a failure -- it would mean the two platforms are not
independently biased but reading the same axis. S53 section 7 caps
what this may be used for.
